# Link checker exclusions (ADR-0022): one regular expression per line, each with its reason.
# Local development server, only up during `npm run dev`.
^https?://localhost
# Backlog templates (docs/backlog/_*.md) link as if copied into stories/: excluded by path in links.yml.
# Standards publishers that refuse automated clients (HTTP 403 to lychee, WebFetch and research
# tools alike, 2026-10-09); their pages are cited with that qualifier in docs/references.md.
^https://library\.iec\.ch/
^https://webstore\.ansi\.org/
^https://www\.iso\.org/
